{"availability":"available","full":"aryxn-builds/handy-eff","name":"handy-eff","description":"Form a frame with your hands like a film director, and watch 10 high-fidelity cinematic, posterized, holographic, and glassmorphic visual effects warp live strictly inside the bounding shape of your fingers.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-12T14:57:13Z","updated":"2026-08-09T09:52:04Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://handy-eff.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://handy-eff.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:09.315Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:09.315Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:09.315Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:18:09.315Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Form a frame with your hands like a film director, and watch 10 high-fidelity cinematic, posterized, holographic, and glassmorphic visual effects warp live strictly inside the bounding shape of your fingers.","🌐 Try the Web App Directly in Your Browser! &bull; 🎬 View All 10 Effects &bull; 🚀 Quickstart","Whether you're exploring computer vision, creating eye-catching social media content, or just having fun directing real-time video, Hand Frame FX transforms your webcam into a dynamic visual FX studio."],"features":["🌐 Universal Dual Engine: Run instantly in any modern web browser via Vercel (web/ folder with OpenCV.js & MediaPipe Vision), or run natively on desktop with maximum Python/OpenCV performance (handyeff.py).","🔷 Dynamic Quadrilateral & Triangular Masking: Form a 4-point frame with both hands (index tips and thumb tips) to create a quadrilateral mask. Pinch one hand to collapse its anchors into a single vertex for a sharp…","⚡ Permissive High-Speed Tracking: Leverages MediaPipe landmark detection with exponential corner smoothing (SMOOTH = 0.55) to eliminate edge jitter and keep the bounding shape rock-solid even during rapid movement.","👐 Natural Gesture Controls: Bring your two hands together (Clap) to automatically cycle to the next visual effect without touching the keyboard. Spread them apart to re-arm.","🎥 Real-Time Clean Recording: Capture composite creations on the fly. The built-in recorder saves a pristine feed of the final output (free of developer skeletons or UI overlays) at a constant, true-to-speed 30 FPS."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryxn-builds/handy-eff/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"50a84ae90f1215bf5cf9d0f52fedc3c6f68410a51df89a4b63febca639aa3864","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:09.462Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:09.462Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Form a frame with your hands like a film director, and watch 10 high-fidelity cinematic, posterized, holographic, and glassmorphic visual effects warp live strictly inside the bounding shape of your fingers.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryxn-builds/handy-eff/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"50a84ae90f1215bf5cf9d0f52fedc3c6f68410a51df89a4b63febca639aa3864","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryxn-builds/handy-eff/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:09.463Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-09T09:52:04Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aryxn-builds/handy-eff/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:09.463Z","hash":"50a84ae90f1215bf5cf9d0f52fedc3c6f68410a51df89a4b63febca639aa3864","originalBytes":10167,"storedBytes":10167,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["python","web","frame","desktop","hand","hands","mediapipe","visual","app","contact","effect","effects","bash","browser","grid","lines","opencv","real-time","run","activate","both","cinematic","eff.py","engine","handy","holographic","index","inside","mask","thumb","tip","venv","webcam","bull","camera","clean","comic","convex","deep","directly","dynamic","filters","gesture","glass","gradient","hull","live","local","make"